# A registry key with a dot is in brackets and quotes in the path, and the
# finding has the line of that key.
exits 1 sv check
cmp stdout want.txt

-- .specval.yaml --
-- .specval/data/services.yaml --
services:
  OrderManager: { layer: manager }
  Order.Accessor: { layer: storage }
-- want.txt --
.specval/data/services.yaml:3 error SR001 Order.Accessor has no valid layer (got "storage") (services["Order.Accessor"])
    fix: Set layer to one of: client, manager, engine, accessor, resource, utility.
specval checked 0 spec(s) and found 1 error(s) and 0 warning(s).
